INTRODUCTION
------------

This is the second Version of This Excellent BuLlDoG PrOdUcTiOnS program
to be released!!!

BuLlDoG PrOdUcTiOnS is a new company set up by Snoopy & Blackmamba to 
produce helpful bbs utils for Cnet. 

This excellent little program is a kewl raw downloader program for
cnet 3.05+.

The first version had a few bugs in, this one hopefully is bug free
Its much neater than the last and has a keyfile requester so REGISTER!
The cost to register is a post card!! easy!

This program one run asks for a password to enter. If the user gets it
correct a selector will pop up and the sysop will select the file(s) to
send the user. Once selected the files will be sent. Simple..


INSTALLATION
------------

copy all the drawer to your pfiles. and edit the program. Change your
bbs name and password to make it unique to your bbs..

Then just load up your BBSMENU and at the end of menu 2; available
everywhere add the following.

RAW  | #0pfiles:rawbull/rawbull.rexx}

thats it.. now reload your menu (Amiga-T on Cnet control) and your
done. Now just logon and type RAW then your password and check that it
works.. 

